<title>BOTSWANA: Debswana Botswana appoints new directors to board.</title>
<headline>Debswana Botswana appoints new directors to board.</headline>
<dateline>GABORONE 1997-08-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Debswana Botswana, the 50/50 diamond-producing partnership between De Beers Ltd and the Botswana government, announced on Monday it had appointed three new directors to its board.</p>
<p>The company said it had appointed attorney Tebelelo Seretse and economics lecturer Imogen Mogotsi as directors effective from June 13, 1997.</p>
<p>Former Debswana Botswana deputy managing director Brian Ainsley had also been appointed to the board with effect from July 14, 1997.</p>
<p>- Gaborone newsroom (+267) 347182</p>
